            "width": 378,
            "height": 73
          },
          {
            "guid": "8151:76103",
            "type": "text",
            "name": "To change a component’s state, select its instance in your file and use properties in the right panel. For what properties a component has, see component pages in this file. The example here is for the Tree node.",
